  "body": "A unique opportunity to secure a spacious four bedroom home on a near-level 829 sqm site just a short walk to East Auckland's top schools.\r\n\r\nThe generous formal and casual living areas are separated by a modern kitchen offering quality appliances and full height cabinetry. A sun-drenched deck provides the ideal space for a morning cuppa or an evening BBQ with family and friends. Four well-proportioned bedrooms, a discrete study and a modern bathroom all cater well for a growing family. Downstairs reveals a double garage, separate laundry, powder room and a large rumpus room; the ideal mancave, workshop or simply extra storage space. \r\n\r\nThe fully fenced, manicured 829sqm grounds offer unrivalled outdoor living for kids and pets while providing the ultimate landbank, with future gains assured. \r\n\r\nTop schools, parks, reserves and sandy beaches are all within easy reach. \r\n\r\nIn-zone for Bucklands Beach Intermediate and Macleans College.",
